reliable screening tools, e.g., chlorophyll absorbance, thermo-imaging

camera system, and electrical root capacitance. A set of faba bean

genotypes was used to screen for drought tolerance. Leaf temperature

depression (LTD), measured with the thermo-imaging system, was},
 author = {Ali, Mohamed B.},
 year = {2015},
