ing genotypic variation for SLA toward selection of greater early vigour in wheat. (C) 2004 Elsevier B.V. All rights reserved.},
 author = {Rebetzke, G. J. and Botwright, T. L. and Moore, C. S. and Richards, R. A. and Condon, A. G.},
